  <item>
    <title>如何写剧本和写小说：类型，情节，结构 #260326</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c618937b0a0bfd334fce9a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c618937b0a0bfd334fce9a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 27 Mar 2026 05:57:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>出差路上读了James Bell写得《这样写出好故事》，讲如何写作小说——《Write great fiction: plot an structure》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不由得和之前在播客「</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6654273c4efbc0c3dc5045f5" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6654273c4efbc0c3dc5045f5"><span>DTC Lab」读书会上读的Blake Snyder的《救猫咪》（Save the cat）</span></a><span>进行对比。</span></p><span></span><p><span>写剧本和写小说当然是不同的，但两位作者都强调了结构的重要，三幕结构，中点（midpoint），第一扇门第二扇门。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我尤其喜欢书里援引一位不喜欢写大纲作家 Ray Bradbury在他书里写得一段话。他说，你的角色跑向让人惊异的结尾时，会在雪地上留下脚印，这就是你情节。情节来自事后观察，而非事前规划。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以，作者的建议就是每个人都可以根据LOCK框架，先写起来，创意灵感情节会自然流动。</span></p><span></span><p><span>———————分界线———————</span></p><span></span><h3><strong><span>Host &nbsp;艾勇 AY</span></strong></h3><span></span><h3><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1445614444" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1445614444"><span>@艾勇</span></a></h3><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/62cffd65000000000e00f8f9?xsec_token=YBRZPLgMi1_YBMPj94l-N1eqKfi-iI391rj4iRrrq5Dhk%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=&amp;shareRedId=N0w5MkZLSkA2NzUyOTgwNjY0OThJSTtA&amp;apptime=1769743541&amp;share_id=f91726765bd74971a776252dba66445b&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/62cffd65000000000e00f8f9?xsec_token=YBRZPLgMi1_YBMPj94l-N1eqKfi-iI391rj4iRrrq5Dhk%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=&amp;shareRedId=N0w5MkZLSkA2NzUyOTgwNjY0OThJSTtA&amp;apptime=1769743541&amp;share_id=f91726765bd74971a776252dba66445b&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>艾勇 | 播客时代</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>主播其他播客节目：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61a9f093ca6141933d1a1c63" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61a9f093ca6141933d1a1c63"><span>「DTC Lab | 未来品牌之路」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6232d09f637f85054eb8401c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6232d09f637f85054eb8401c"><span>「以变应变 | 未来组织之路」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67b6edf1506c1f87ee29cf15" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67b6edf1506c1f87ee29cf15"><span>「健谈 | 未来健康之路」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63230520599af9d46556583e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63230520599af9d46556583e"><span>「成为巴菲特」</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【Staff】</span></p><span></span><p><span>视觉设计：猫哥</span></p><span></span><h3><span>【Space】</span></h3><span></span><p><span>BeyondPod Netwok | BPN 播客网络录音室 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;上海 | 北京 | 广州 | 深圳 | 厦门 | 武汉 | 香港</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu8qsLym0gv-mOllroQ55ax8tTcv.png"></figure>]]></description>
