  <item>
    <title>一对一沟通 #260323</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c3464b4a34541b1bee167d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c3464b4a34541b1bee167d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Mar 2026 02:28:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们大量的管理工作都是通过沟通或者会议完成的，沟通或者会议通常有三种类型：一对一，一对小范围，一对多。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一对一是最重要的沟通形式，不仅是工作，所有值得被看见被听到的关系都需要做好一对一沟通。</span></p><span></span><p><span>地球上研究会议最多的教授Steven Gogelberg的书，由我最喜欢的兰西奥尼系列书的译者刘向东老师翻译推荐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>跟大家分享，希望我们都能让重要的一对一成为对方期待的时间！</span></p><span></span><p><span>———————分界线———————</span></p><span></span><h3><strong><span>Host &nbsp;艾勇 AY</span></strong></h3><span></span><h3><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1445614444" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1445614444"><span>@艾勇</span></a></h3><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/62cffd65000000000e00f8f9?xsec_token=YBRZPLgMi1_YBMPj94l-N1eqKfi-iI391rj4iRrrq5Dhk%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=&amp;shareRedId=N0w5MkZLSkA2NzUyOTgwNjY0OThJSTtA&amp;apptime=1769743541&amp;share_id=f91726765bd74971a776252dba66445b&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/62cffd65000000000e00f8f9?xsec_token=YBRZPLgMi1_YBMPj94l-N1eqKfi-iI391rj4iRrrq5Dhk%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=&amp;shareRedId=N0w5MkZLSkA2NzUyOTgwNjY0OThJSTtA&amp;apptime=1769743541&amp;share_id=f91726765bd74971a776252dba66445b&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>艾勇 | 播客时代</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>主播其他播客节目：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61a9f093ca6141933d1a1c63" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61a9f093ca6141933d1a1c63"><span>「DTC Lab | 未来品牌之路」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6232d09f637f85054eb8401c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6232d09f637f85054eb8401c"><span>「以变应变 | 未来组织之路」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67b6edf1506c1f87ee29cf15" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67b6edf1506c1f87ee29cf15"><span>「健谈 | 未来健康之路」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63230520599af9