    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>人生下半场应该去攀登第二座山。以终为始，倒过来活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当你像99岁的芒格一样，在人生的最后时间里，你会想给谁打电话，做最后的告别？</span></p><span></span><p><span>你们会说什么，你会是什么样的表情和心情？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这应该是个很好的test，指导我们在当下做出一些重要的选择。</span></p><span></span><p><span>———————分界线———————</span></p><span></span><h3><strong><span>Host &nbsp;艾勇 AY</span></strong></h3><span></span><h3><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1445614444" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1445614444"><span>@艾勇</span></a></h3><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/62cffd65000000000e00f8f9?xsec_token=YBRZPLgMi1_YBMPj94l-N1eqKfi-iI391rj4iRrrq5Dhk%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=&amp;shareRedId=N0w5MkZLSkA2NzUyOTgwNjY0OThJSTtA&amp;apptime=1769743541&amp;share_id=f91726765bd74971a776252dba66445b&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/62cffd65000000000e00f8f9?xsec_token=YBRZPLgMi1_YBMPj94l-N1eqKfi-iI391rj4iRrrq5Dhk%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=&amp;shareRedId=N0w5MkZLSkA2NzUyOTgwNjY0OThJSTtA&amp;apptime=1769743541&amp;share_id=f91726765bd74971a776252dba66445b&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>艾勇 | 播客时代</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>主播其他播客节目：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61a9f093ca6141933d1a1c63" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61a9f093ca6141933d1a1c63"><span>「DTC Lab | 未来品牌之路」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6232d09f637f85054eb8401c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6232d09f637f85054eb8401c"><span>「以变应变 | 未来组织之路」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67b6edf1506c1f87ee29cf15" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67b6edf1506c1f87ee29cf15"><span>「健谈 | 未来健康之路」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63230520599af9d46556583e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63230520