    <pubDate>Fri, 20 Mar 2026 07:08:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近带孩子学英语，想起自己十年前写过的一篇公号文章，拿出来分享一下。 &nbsp;→ </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/G139X8MVyZ-nEFmGWuVZfA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/G139X8MVyZ-nEFmGWuVZfA"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>新概念是L.G.Alexander于1967年写的英语教材，我自己读书的时候学过，现在给孩子讲英语。</span></p><span></span><p><span>很汗颜。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nothing should be spoken before it has been heard.</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nothing should be read before it has been spoken.</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nothing should be written before it has been read.</span></p><span></span><p><span>也借此宣布，停更了一年的这档播客，在26年更新起来了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>———————分界线———————</span></p><span></span><h3><span>【Host】</span></h3><span></span><h3><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1445614444" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1445614444"><span>@艾勇</span></a></h3><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/62cffd65000000000e00f8f9?xsec_token=YBRZPLgMi1_YBMPj94l-N1eqKfi-iI391rj4iRrrq5Dhk%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=&amp;shareRedId=N0w5MkZLSkA2NzUyOTgwNjY0OThJSTtA&amp;apptime=1769743541&amp;share_id=f91726765bd74971a776252dba66445b&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/62cffd65000000000e00f8f9?xsec_token=YBRZPLgMi1_YBMPj94l-N1eqKfi-iI391rj4iRrrq5Dhk%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=&amp;shareRedId=N0w5MkZLSkA2NzUyOTgwNjY0OThJSTtA&amp;apptime=1769743541&amp;share_id=f91726765bd74971a776252dba66445b&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>艾勇 | 播客时代</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>主播其他播客节目：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61a9f093ca6141933d1a1c63" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61a9f093ca6141933d1a1c63"><span>「DTC Lab | 未来品牌之路」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6232d09f637f85054eb8401c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6232d09f637f85